        //     legs' pushes (machineAuthor login, e.g. the rework
        //     WIP auto-saves on fa pr-1094) are not new work. A
        //     machine merge ON TOP of a human push is not machine
        //     work either (#681, live fa#1213: retrigger 7ecf11d7
